# Keep the build context small and deterministic. The build stage compiles from
# source only; everything below is either runtime state, local tooling, build
# output, or docs that never belong in the image.

# Runtime state: SQLite DB file and WAL sidecars (ADR-0003).
/data/

# Build output.
/bin/
/life-ledger
/life-ledger.exe

# Go test/coverage artifacts.
*.out

# VCS, CI, IaC, and docs — not needed to compile the binary.
.git/
.github/
infra/
docs/
*.md

# Editor/OS cruft.
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
